{
    "info": {
        "name": "SAER.PK - Kuickpay APIs",
        "description": "Test SAER.PK's Kuickpay integration endpoints\n\nThese are YOUR Django APIs that your frontend calls.\nThey internally proxy requests to Kuickpay's service.\n\nBase URL: http://127.0.0.1:8000 (or http://localhost:8000 for local testing)",
