        {
            "name": "Kuickpay Integration",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Bill Inquiry",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Authorization",
                                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                                "type": "text"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/kuickpay/bill-inquiry/?consumer_number=095716373739&bank_mnemonic=KPY&reserved=",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "kuickpay",
                                "bill-inquiry",
                                ""
                            ],
                            "query": [
                                {
                                    "key": "consumer_number",
                                    "value": "095716373739",
                                    "description": "Consumer/utility account number (18 digits)"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "bank_mnemonic",
                                    "value": "KPY",
                                    "description": "Bank identifier"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "reserved",
                                    "value": "",
                                    "description": "Optional reserved field"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Query bill information from Kuickpay.\n\n**Authentication:** Required (JWT Bearer token)\n\n**Query Parameters:**\n- `consumer_number` (required): Consumer account number\n- `bank_mnemonic` (required): Bank identifier (e.g., 'KPY')\n- `reserved` (optional): Reserved field\n\n**Expected Response (from Kuickpay):**\n```json\n{\n  \"response_Code\": \"00\",\n  \"consumer_Detail\": \"CUSTOMER NAME\",\n  \"bill_status\": \"U\",\n  \"due_date\": \"20241014\",\n  \"amount_within_dueDate\": \"+0000000186900\",\n  \"amount_after_dueDate\": \"+0000000202500\",\n  \"email_address\": \"example@gmail.com\",\n  \"contact_number\": \"03030303030\",\n  \"billing_month\": \"2410\",\n  \"date_paid\": \"\",\n  \"amount_paid\": \"\",\n  \"tran_auth_Id\": \"\",\n  \"reserved\": \"\"\n}\n```\n\n**Response Codes:**\n- '00' = Success\n- '01' = Invalid consumer number\n- '02' = Blocked/Inactive\n- '03' = Unknown error\n- '04' = Invalid data\n- '05' = Service failed\n\n**Bill Status:**\n- 'U' = Unpaid (payment allowed)\n- 'P' = Paid (no further payment)\n- 'B' = Blocked\n- 'T' = Top-up voucher"
                    },
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "name": "Success - Unpaid Bill",
                            "originalRequest": {
                                "method": "GET",
                                "header": [
                                    {
                                        "key": "Authorization",
                                        "value": "Bearer eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..."
                                    }
                                ],
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/kuickpay/bill-inquiry/?consumer_number=095716373739&bank_mnemonic=KPY",
                                    "protocol": "http",
                                    "host": [
                                        "localhost"
                                    ],
                                    "port": "8000",
                                    "path": [
                                        "api",
                                        "kuickpay",
                                        "bill-inquiry",
                                        ""
                                    ],
                                    "query": [
                                        {
                                            "key": "consumer_number",
                                            "value": "095716373739"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "key": "bank_mnemonic",
                                            "value": "KPY"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            },
                            "status": "OK",
                            "code": 200,
                            "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                            "header": [
                                {
                                    "key": "Content-Type",
                                    "value": "application/json"
                                }
                            ],
                            "body": "{\n  \"response_Code\": \"00\",\n  \"consumer_Detail\": \"MUHAMMAD FEROZ\",\n  \"bill_status\": \"U\",\n  \"due_date\": \"20241014\",\n  \"amount_within_dueDate\": \"+0000000186900\",\n  \"amount_after_dueDate\": \"+0000000202500\",\n  \"email_address\": \"example@gmail.com\",\n  \"contact_number\": \"03030303030\",\n  \"billing_month\": \"2410\",\n  \"date_paid\": \"\",\n  \"amount_paid\": \"\",\n  \"tran_auth_Id\": \"\",\n  \"reserved\": \"\"\n}"
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Error - Missing Parameters",
                            "originalRequest": {
                                "method": "GET",
                                "header": [
                                    {
                                        "key": "Authorization",
                                        "value": "Bearer eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..."
                                    }
                                ],
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/kuickpay/bill-inquiry/",
                                    "protocol": "http",
                                    "host": [
                                        "localhost"
                                    ],
                                    "port": "8000",
                                    "path": [
                                        "api",
                                        "kuickpay",
                                        "bill-inquiry",
                                        ""
                                    ]
                                }
                            },
                            "status": "Bad Request",
                            "code": 400,
                            "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                            "header": [
                                {
                                    "key": "Content-Type",
                                    "value": "application/json"
                                }
                            ],
                            "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"consumer_number and bank_mnemonic are required\"\n}"
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Error - Kuickpay Connection Failed",
                            "originalRequest": {
                                "method": "GET",
                                "header": [
                                    {
                                        "key": "Authorization",
                                        "value": "Bearer eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..."
                                    }
                                ],
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/kuickpay/bill-inquiry/?consumer_number=095716373739&bank_mnemonic=KPY",
                                    "protocol": "http",
                                    "host": [
                                        "localhost"
                                    ],
                                    "port": "8000",
                                    "path": [
                                        "api",
                                        "kuickpay",
                                        "bill-inquiry",
                                        ""
                                    ],
                                    "query": [
                                        {
                                            "key": "consumer_number",
                                            "value": "095716373739"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "key": "bank_mnemonic",
                                            "value": "KPY"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            },
                            "status": "Internal Server Error",
                            "code": 500,
                            "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                            "header": [
                                {
                                    "key": "Content-Type",
                                    "value": "application/json"
                                }
                            ],
                            "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"Kuickpay request failed: HTTPConnectionPool(host='localhost', port=8000): Max retries exceeded\"\n}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Bill Payment",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Authorization",
                                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                                "type": "text"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json",
                                "type": "text"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"consumer_number\": \"0000812345\",\n  \"tran_auth_id\": \"AUTH123456\",\n  \"transaction_amount\": \"1869.00\",\n  \"tran_date\": \"20241215\",\n  \"tran_time\": \"143022\",\n  \"bank_mnemonic\": \"KPY\",\n  \"reserved\": \"\"\n}",
                            "options": {
                                "raw": {
                                    "language": "json"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/kuickpay/bill-payment/",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "api",
                                "kuickpay",
                                "bill-payment",
                                ""
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Process bill payment through Kuickpay.\n\n**Authentication:** Required (JWT Bearer token)\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `consumer_number` (required): Consumer account number (18 digits)\n- `tran_auth_id` (required): Transaction authorization ID (6 digits)\n- `transaction_amount` (required): Amount as decimal string (e.g., \"1869.00\")\n  - Backend automatically converts to AN14 format: \"+0000000186900\"\n- `tran_date` (required): Transaction date (YYYYMMDD)\n- `tran_time` (required): Transaction time (HHMMSS)\n- `bank_mnemonic` (required): Bank identifier\n- `reserved` (optional): Reserved field\n\n**Expected Response (from Kuickpay):**\n```json\n{\n  \"response_Code\": \"00\",\n  \"Identification_parameter\": \"receipt_id_or_email\",\n  \"reserved\": \"\"\n}\n```\n\n**Response Codes:**\n- '00' = Success\n- '01' = Invalid voucher number\n- '02' = Blocked/Inactive\n- '03' = Duplicate/Bad transaction\n- '04' = Invalid data\n- '05' = Service failed"
                    },
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "name": "Success",
                            "originalRequest": {
                                "method": "POST",
                                "header": [
                                    {
                                        "key": "Authorization",
                                        "value": "Bearer eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..."
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "key": "Content-Type",
                                        "value": "application/json"
                                    }
                                ],
                                "body": {
                                    "mode": "raw",
                                    "raw": "{\n  \"consumer_number\": \"0000812345\",\n  \"tran_auth_id\": \"AUTH123456\",\n  \"transaction_amount\": \"1869.00\",\n  \"tran_date\": \"20241215\",\n  \"tran_time\": \"143022\",\n  \"bank_mnemonic\": \"KPY\",\n  \"reserved\": \"\"\n}"
                                },
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/kuickpay/bill-payment/",
                                    "protocol": "http",
                                    "host": [
                                        "localhost"
                                    ],
                                    "port": "8000",
                                    "path": [
                                        "api",
                                        "kuickpay",
                                        "bill-payment",
                                        ""
                                    ]
                                }
